    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "5d727be96f0c4e5e5ada": "The battle for Arathi Basin is a battle for resources.  Lumber, ore, food... all these are needed in order to wage a good war.$B$BDenying our enemies of their supplies is as good as killing them on the battlefield."
      },
